{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944000/extras/ASS_Steam_Description_Image_Title.png?t=1744219228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arcade Space Survivor</strong> is an arcade-styled action-roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect EXP, upgrade your spaceship and survive in this retro-inspired shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arcade Space Survivor</strong> offers an innovative and unique</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">gameplay experience in the existing Survivors-like genre.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944000/extras/0.6_Gameplay_1.gif?t=1744219228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944000/extras/ASS_Steam_Description_Image_Special.png?t=1744219228\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No mouse required (<i>perfect for laptop</i>) (<i>controller</i> r<i>ecommended)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Instead of <strong>HP</strong> the player has <strong>LIFES</strong> (<i>like in old arcade games</i>).\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exp</strong> will disappear after a certain time (around <i>10 seconds</i>).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944000/extras/ASS_Steam_read_more_lime.png?t=1744219228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944000/extras/0.6_Gameplay_3.gif?t=1744219228\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944000/extras/ASS_Description_Image_Features.png?t=1744219228\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online Leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gamemodes: Survival, Daily Run, Challenges </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 Attacks - 76 Upgrades - 197 Levels (additional content planned) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 different enemy types (additional content planned)  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Point of Interests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PowerUps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deadly meteors for player and enemies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944000/extras/0.6_Gameplay_2.gif?t=1744219228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game by: Marvin Woelke / MAWO</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2944000?t=1744219228","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944000/01f32b9e8f3b707d27913cc7ccbfe7a12e0bc401/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744219228","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944000/5fadee40b20fe7fdc50f21a67abc76078c9c9374/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744219228","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944000/5fadee40b20fe7fdc50f21a67abc76078c9c9374/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744219228","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944000/extras/ASS_Steam